Package: rsagePlan
Title: Analysis Planner Module for R Sage
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("R Sage contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@rsage.dev")
Description: Turns a research question (goal, outcome, groups or
    predictors, design) into an analysis plan. It profiles the chosen
    variables (kind, groups and their sizes, skew, normality, pairing,
    events per predictor) and picks the analysis, its options, the checks
    to run and the alternatives by fixed, documented rules, so the same
    question on the same data always gets the same plan. The plan opens
    the chosen analysis; nothing is fitted here.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: rsage (>= 0.1.0), ggplot2, stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
